        "Title": "Ballad of the Drinkler",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102368454974",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7809503d-5324-4e73-8915-db8b1e029151).Image",
        "Description": "Mr. Drinks has been invited upstairs, where the FINEST champagne is waiting for him. The only problem is, this unsavory &quot;Eric&quot; fellow is using Mr. Drinks&apos; iconic blue vest specifically for  having champagne! He NEEDS that $hit! Maybe a tuxedo will be fine until he gets a hold of that RAT bastard...\r\rAnd speaking of rats, maybe this new group will be smarter than to drink his rat poison stew...",
